WEBVTT

01:30.900 --> 01:35.700
Please continue to
watch over Shouquan

01:35.900 --> 01:39.900
See that he doesn't get choked
on elixirs again. Thank you

01:39.900 --> 01:41.900
Don't believe in the elixir

01:42.800 --> 01:46.800
Joined Brow is only a robber.
He isn't a divine physician at all

01:46.800 --> 01:50.800
Swordswoman, you're here!
Please have a seat!

01:51.100 --> 01:53.100
Pour her some water

01:53.900 --> 01:59.500
You've done us a really big favour,
Swordswoman

01:59.500 --> 02:01.500
She's your saviour

02:01.500 --> 02:05.900
Had it not been for her,
you'd long have died

02:06.900 --> 02:09.900
How can we thank you enough?

02:09.900 --> 02:12.900
-I must say you're a living buddha
-A living buddha?

02:12.900 --> 02:15.900
It's thanks to
that cursed Zhang Guolao...

02:15.900 --> 02:18.900
My mother is praising you.
What are you mumbling about?

02:18.900 --> 02:19.900
Nothing

02:21.000 --> 02:24.000
-How are you?
-I'm a lot better

02:24.000 --> 02:26.000
Thanks for saving my life

02:26.000 --> 02:29.000
Don't mention it.
You have a lot to thank me for

02:29.000 --> 02:30.800
I beg your pardon?

02:30.800 --> 02:34.800
I mean, he has the looks of a blessed
man, so he's bound to come to no harm

02:35.000 --> 02:39.000
That's where you're wrong.
Don't be deceived by his looks

02:39.000 --> 02:43.000
He may look strong and fit,
but he's actually a very unlucky man

02:43.000 --> 02:47.000
He's always having stomachaches
or passing out

02:47.000 --> 02:53.000
Had you not saved him this time,
he'd long have gone to meet his Maker

02:53.000 --> 02:56.600
You're indeed Shou's saviour,
Swordswoman

02:57.000 --> 03:00.600
Don't keep calling me Swordswoman.
It's rather embarrassing

03:02.000 --> 03:06.600
We'll address you as Miss Ma then.
Miss Ma, what's your full name?

03:06.600 --> 03:07.600
It's...

03:10.600 --> 03:11.600
Miss Ma?

03:13.600 --> 03:15.600
Just call me Ruyi

03:15.600 --> 03:18.600
Ruyi?
That's a good name

03:19.000 --> 03:23.600
Everything will go well (ruyi)
for Shou when he's with you

03:24.000 --> 03:28.800
Let's all kowtow to Miss Ma Ruyi
for having saved Shou

03:30.000 --> 03:35.000
No need for that. I can't keep saving
him. He must learn to save himself

03:35.000 --> 03:37.000
-Save myself?
-Save himself?

03:37.000 --> 03:41.000
From today on, you're to build yourself
up according to the instructions here

03:41.000 --> 03:43.600
Martial arts?
Surely not?

03:43.600 --> 03:46.000
Miss Ma, he knows nothing
about martial arts

03:46.000 --> 03:48.000
That's why he has to learn it

03:48.000 --> 03:52.000
You're weak because there's no routine
in your life. You have to change

03:52.000 --> 03:54.000
By practising the Five-Animal Exercise,

03:54.000 --> 03:58.000
you'll have good brains, a strong heart,
flexible joints and healthy kidneys

03:58.000 --> 04:01.000
I'm not interested in martial arts

04:01.000 --> 04:04.000
You must master it by the age of 30
no matter what!

04:04.000 --> 04:06.600
By the age of 30?!
Why?

04:07.000 --> 04:11.600
Is it because you know
my son won't live pass 30?

04:12.000 --> 04:17.600
Just entrust him to me and I assure you
he'll live to a ripe old age

04:17.600 --> 04:18.600
Really?

04:19.000 --> 04:23.000
Sure, if he practises 4 hours each
in the morning, afternoon and evening

04:24.000 --> 04:28.000
So many hours? How would I
find time to eat and sleep then?

04:28.000 --> 04:30.000
Don't interrupt.
Hear Miss Ma out

04:30.000 --> 04:34.000
You eat and sleep too much, and work
too little. That's why you're so weak

04:34.000 --> 04:36.000
You're to kick those bad habits

04:36.000 --> 04:40.000
And memorize all the strokes in the
book before you sleep every night...

04:40.000 --> 04:42.000
to facilitate next day's training

04:42.000 --> 04:45.000
-I'll check every 3 days
-Check?

04:45.000 --> 04:48.000
To make sure you're working hard.
I'll be standing by you

04:48.000 --> 04:50.000
What?
You can't be serious

04:50.000 --> 04:52.000
Till you've mastered the exercise

04:52.000 --> 04:58.000
You've taken the words out of my mouth,
Miss Ma! Please take him in hand for me

04:58.000 --> 05:02.000
He may be 28, but he still
behaves like a child

05:02.000 --> 05:05.000
He isn't as easy to handle
as my little niece

05:05.600 --> 05:08.600
But don't be scared off by him

05:08.600 --> 05:12.600
I won't be. When he was born,
he peed at me right in the face

05:12.600 --> 05:15.000
What? I peed at you in the face?

05:17.000 --> 05:21.000
I mean my little brother is as naughty
as him. He also pees everywhere

05:21.000 --> 05:24.600
So I'm leaving my son with you

05:25.000 --> 05:29.000
Ma-jiejie, you're so good to my uncle.
I'll treat you to tangguan

05:29.000 --> 05:30.000
Sure

05:30.000 --> 05:34.000
Can you tell me why
you're wearing a veil?

05:36.000 --> 05:38.600
Can I see your face?

05:43.800 --> 05:44.800
All right

06:05.000 --> 06:07.000
What are you packing for?

06:07.000 --> 06:09.000
Young Master wants to set off earlier

06:09.000 --> 06:11.600
-Did he say that himself?
-Yes

06:11.600 --> 06:13.800
He even studied till
late in the night

06:13.800 --> 06:14.800
Really?

06:17.000 --> 06:20.000
Son, I heard you're setting off
for the Capital earlier

06:20.000 --> 06:22.600
I can't wait to get to the Capital

06:22.600 --> 06:24.000
After that?

06:24.000 --> 06:26.000
-I'll excel in the exams
-Good

06:26.000 --> 06:28.000
I'll be the top scholar...

06:29.000 --> 06:32.000
and take over the entire yamen

06:32.000 --> 06:34.600
Good! You have ambition!

06:35.000 --> 06:37.800
After that?

06:38.000 --> 06:44.000
I'll become the master of Golden
Swallow, the No 1 lady constable!

06:44.000 --> 06:46.000
I'll prove myself to her!

06:48.000 --> 06:53.000
You're studying just because you
want to prove yourself to that woman?

06:53.000 --> 06:55.000
What a disgrace you are!

06:56.000 --> 06:58.600
Do you know how she humiliated me?

06:59.000 --> 07:03.000
I'm a man. I can't possibly
take that lying down

07:03.000 --> 07:08.000
As the saying goes, "If a dragon falls,
it's no different from a worm"

07:08.000 --> 07:11.600
"A water dragon on dry land
is same as a fish out of water"

07:11.600 --> 07:15.000
I can't stand being looked down on
by a woman!

07:15.000 --> 07:20.000
So it's actually a woman
who made you, a man,

07:20.000 --> 07:22.000
go to the Capital

07:30.600 --> 07:31.600
Young Master!

07:47.000 --> 07:51.600
I'm human. Why should I imitate
the actions of these animals?

07:52.000 --> 07:53.600
I quit!

07:59.000 --> 08:04.000
I'm surprised you know
how to fly too

08:04.000 --> 08:06.000
Can you teach me?

08:06.000 --> 08:08.600
You can do it too if you
master the Five-Animal Exercise

08:08.600 --> 08:11.600
You must be joking.
Me, flying, given my size?

08:13.000 --> 08:15.000
Hold it there!

08:15.000 --> 08:20.000
Come on, don't waste your effort.
I'm so heavy. How can I possibly fly?

08:20.000 --> 08:22.600
It's utterly impossible, right?

08:23.000 --> 08:26.600
-How much have you grasped?
-I've finished the whole book

08:26.600 --> 08:30.600
-Do you understand everything then?
-Not one bit of it

08:37.000 --> 08:38.400
Chest out!

08:39.800 --> 08:41.800
I want you to do a stance!

08:42.000 --> 08:43.000
Ma...

08:43.000 --> 08:45.600
Be quiet and concentrate on
your exercise

08:45.600 --> 08:48.000
What I mean is, my legs are numb (ma)

08:48.000 --> 08:50.600
It happens when you
practise martial arts

08:50.600 --> 08:55.000
Before assigning big tasks to you,
Heaven will put you through the mill

08:55.000 --> 08:58.000
-Surely you've learnt that in school?
-Yes

08:58.000 --> 09:03.000
But are you doing that? No.
You've lived in vain for 28 years!

09:03.000 --> 09:08.600
Indeed. I can only see white
in front of me now...

09:09.000 --> 09:13.000
Wait till you're used to such training.
You'll become fitter

09:13.000 --> 09:16.600
It beats your mother's solution
to get you a wife

09:17.000 --> 09:20.600
I really need to lean
against a big tree...

09:20.600 --> 09:22.600
What's the matter?

09:23.000 --> 09:27.000
I sometimes have giddy spells
even when I'm resting at home

09:27.000 --> 09:32.000
You expect me to stay in this position
for hours. I might just drop dead

09:37.000 --> 09:40.000
How feeble can you be!

09:44.800 --> 09:46.800
Get up!
Stop pretending!

09:50.000 --> 09:52.000
What's the meaning of this?!

09:54.880 --> 09:57.000
Why did you ask us out, Lu?

09:58.000 --> 10:02.000
It's like this.
I'll be away for some time

10:02.000 --> 10:03.600
Why?

10:03.600 --> 10:07.600
I'm going to the Capital to sit
the imperial exam. So farewell

10:10.000 --> 10:16.600
I say, this is more novel than
Shou being made to learn martial arts

10:17.000 --> 10:21.600
Didn't you vow never to step into
an examination hall? Why are you...?

10:21.600 --> 10:23.600
What happened?

10:24.000 --> 10:31.000
Shou is forced to learn martial arts.
That's rather normal

10:31.000 --> 10:35.600
But you're going to the Capital
to sit the exams. That's strange

10:35.600 --> 10:38.000
Are you a changed person?
Why?

10:38.000 --> 10:39.000
Why?

10:39.000 --> 10:45.000
I've got it! Don't tell me
it was Ma Ruyi who made you go

10:46.000 --> 10:48.600
Speak the truth, quick!

10:49.000 --> 10:54.600
The very mention of Ma Ruyi
makes me mad! She's too much!

10:55.000 --> 11:01.000
I must top the exams
and teach her a lesson!

11:01.000 --> 11:04.000
See if she dares be so arrogant again

11:06.000 --> 11:12.000
Is Golden Swallow this incredible?
She's actually got you under her thumb!

11:12.000 --> 11:14.000
You two are really useless!

11:15.000 --> 11:20.000
Don't laugh at us. We're the Trio.
She'll come to you sooner or later

11:21.000 --> 11:23.600
I have a feeling you'll be
her next target

11:24.000 --> 11:30.000
I'm not afraid of her! If she comes,
she's going to get it from me!

12:05.000 --> 12:07.800
Make way!

12:14.000 --> 12:17.600
You've been following me.
What do you want?

12:18.000 --> 12:20.600
I'm here specially for you

12:26.600 --> 12:30.000
Going to ask me to learn martial arts
before I turn 30?

12:30.000 --> 12:34.000
Oh please! I'm not going to
imitate the actions of animals

12:34.000 --> 12:38.000
Neither am I a man of letters.
Don't expect me to sit the imperial exams

12:39.000 --> 12:42.000
Relax. You're so bright
I won't have to teach you

12:42.000 --> 12:43.600
Glad you know that

12:44.000 --> 12:47.000
You only have to promise
not to do these again!

12:49.600 --> 12:51.000
The 10 Commandments?

12:51.000 --> 12:54.600
That's right. Kick all these
bad habits before you're 30

12:55.000 --> 13:00.000
No gambling, no fighting,
no lying, no engaging in flattery...

13:00.000 --> 13:02.000
No robbing, no stealing, no cheating

13:02.000 --> 13:05.000
No idling,
no indulging in women and wine

13:05.000 --> 13:08.000
Last one -
no seeing of Joined Brow again!

13:09.000 --> 13:10.000
Why?

13:11.800 --> 13:16.000
Mei Shouquan and Wei Delu aren't doing
what they should but you're the opposite

13:16.000 --> 13:19.600
That's why you must kick
all your bad habits!

13:20.000 --> 13:23.600
I'm asking you why
I can't see my teacher again

13:25.000 --> 13:30.000
Why stick with that robber? Going to
learn to commit crimes from him?

13:30.000 --> 13:32.600
He who lies with dogs
will rise with fleas

13:33.000 --> 13:38.000
He was forced to become an outlaw.
He's actually a Robin Hood

13:38.000 --> 13:42.000
He got you to help him get Gem-faced
Leopard out and you still believe him?

13:42.000 --> 13:47.000
That shows he's a worthy friend
who treasures friendship

13:48.000 --> 13:50.000
I don't believe this

13:50.000 --> 13:55.600
Were you scared dumb by the God of Plague
when you were born? Let me have a look

13:56.000 --> 13:59.000
You're the God of Plague!

13:59.000 --> 14:01.600
He nearly caused your buddy's death,
you know!

14:02.000 --> 14:05.000
You were the one at fault, not him!

14:05.800 --> 14:06.800
Me?

14:06.800 --> 14:12.800
Had you not expelled the pill,
Shou would've recovered completely

14:16.000 --> 14:18.000
He isn't worthy of teaching at all

14:20.000 --> 14:24.000
Well, don't bother to teach me then.
You're not cut out for it

14:25.000 --> 14:28.000
I suggest you get married quickly

14:28.000 --> 14:33.000
Don't look too fierce or behave like
a shrew, or you'll be left on the shelf

14:33.000 --> 14:37.000
I don't mind settling for you though

14:37.000 --> 14:40.000
I'm still a bachelor anyway

14:48.000 --> 14:50.000
No engaging in flattery

14:50.000 --> 14:53.600
How dare you hit me!
I'll get you for this!

15:05.000 --> 15:09.000
Memorize the 10 Commandments or else!

15:11.000 --> 15:12.800
Help...!

15:13.000 --> 15:19.000
Come and have a look
at this disobedient lad...!

15:21.000 --> 15:24.000
Did you put away the book
I passed you last night?

15:24.000 --> 15:28.000
-Where's the book I passed you?
-When did you pass me any book?

15:28.000 --> 15:30.000
I passed it to you last night

15:30.000 --> 15:32.000
No, you didn't

15:33.000 --> 15:36.000
-I passed it to you
-And I passed it to you before turning in

15:36.000 --> 15:38.000
He passed it to you

15:40.000 --> 15:42.600
Young Master, all our books are gone

15:43.000 --> 15:48.000
I'd rather you two were gone!
Fancy losing my books!

15:54.000 --> 15:59.600
Fancy you forgetting your books. I even
have to go back to get them for you

16:10.000 --> 16:12.000
Young Master...

16:17.600 --> 16:22.000
Young Master...!
I didn't do it on purpose...!

17:06.000 --> 17:07.000
What happened?!

17:09.000 --> 17:10.800
Young Master...

17:15.800 --> 17:17.800
You gave me a scare!

17:22.600 --> 17:26.600
You won't let me see my teacher?
Well, I'm going to do just that!

17:26.600 --> 17:31.000
Wait till I've learnt a skill or two
from Teacher! I'll get even with you!

17:31.000 --> 17:34.000
I'll tie you and hang you up
on the city gate!

17:36.000 --> 17:41.000
You need to be taught a lesson or you
won't be able to tell right from wrong

17:48.000 --> 17:54.000
My dear teacher! Your dear disciple,
Wu Fuqi, has come to look for you!

17:55.000 --> 17:56.600
My dear teacher!

17:58.000 --> 18:00.000
My dear teacher!

18:01.000 --> 18:07.000
So you really have ganged up
with Golden Swallow on me!

18:07.000 --> 18:12.000
You're asking for it!
I'll send you to your Makers today!

18:14.000 --> 18:16.000
My dear teacher!

18:16.600 --> 18:19.600
You're no disciple of mine!

18:21.000 --> 18:25.000
I'm over here... Come on,
I'll send you to the nether world...

18:26.800 --> 18:29.800
Let me give you hell first!

18:37.000 --> 18:38.600
Teacher...!

18:56.000 --> 18:58.000
Stop there!

19:03.000 --> 19:06.000
-It's you!
-That's right! You should thank me!

19:07.000 --> 19:10.000
My foot!
The last time, you tied me up

19:10.000 --> 19:14.000
Now you tried to crush me with rocks!
And you expect me to thank you?!

19:15.000 --> 19:18.000
I tried to crush you?
Joined Brow...

19:19.000 --> 19:22.000
Oh, it was my teacher
you tried to harm

19:23.000 --> 19:27.000
Let me tell you - he's shrewd.
He's long hidden himself

19:27.000 --> 19:32.000
No way will you be able to
trick him. Fool!

19:34.800 --> 19:36.800
Why did you slap me?

19:37.000 --> 19:41.800
I told you you're not to see your teacher
again! The slap was to remind you!

19:43.000 --> 19:45.600
My dear, it's my business that...

19:45.600 --> 19:49.600
I'm abandoning myself to vice
and that I'm good-for-nothing

19:50.000 --> 19:55.000
Lu and Shou are more promising than me.
Why not spend time on them instead?

19:55.000 --> 19:56.600
Thanks

19:56.600 --> 20:00.000
I will take them in hand.
But you're not exempted!

20:00.000 --> 20:05.000
Remember to copy the 10 Commandments
100 times every morning!

20:05.000 --> 20:08.600
-100 times?! You're crazy!
-I'll be watching you!

20:14.000 --> 20:16.000
Why is my face so itchy?

20:18.000 --> 20:24.000
What are you looking at?!
Don't you misbehave! I have to go!

20:30.000 --> 20:32.600
What a shrew she is!

20:33.000 --> 20:37.000
Would I dare misbehave
with you around?

20:39.000 --> 20:44.000
Oh Heaven, please help me!
Strike her to death by lightning!

20:44.000 --> 20:46.000
What did you say?!

20:54.000 --> 20:56.600
My sister Ma-gu!

20:59.000 --> 21:03.800
Good timing. Look at my face.
Do I look awful?

21:08.600 --> 21:12.600
Indeed you have some freckles on
your face. But they aren't obvious

21:12.600 --> 21:15.600
And they'll go off in 3 days

21:16.000 --> 21:18.000
I have to wait 3 days?

21:19.000 --> 21:22.000
Oh, see how ugly I look!

21:22.000 --> 21:24.000
Who told you to use your powers?

21:24.000 --> 21:28.600
Well, I'm an immortal. What has that
to do with my freckles anyway?

21:28.600 --> 21:30.600
Everything!

21:30.600 --> 21:35.600
If you want to subdue some demon to save
the people, you may use your powers

21:35.600 --> 21:39.600
But you're not supposed to use them
to save the Trio

21:39.600 --> 21:43.600
But why? They're mortals now.
Why can't I use my powers to save them?

21:44.000 --> 21:48.000
Just think. They're sent to the
mortal world because they've sinned

21:48.000 --> 21:52.000
They must suffer 3 ordeals, 6 hardships
and 8 tribulations before they can return

21:52.000 --> 21:56.000
If you use your powers to ward off
all the disasters for them,

21:56.000 --> 21:59.600
you'll be going against the Jade Emperor
and will be punished!

22:01.000 --> 22:04.000
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

22:04.000 --> 22:06.500
Had I told you, would you still
be willing to go to the mortal world?

22:06.500 --> 22:11.500
So you tricked me.
I'm washing my hands of the Trio!

22:11.500 --> 22:17.500
You can't quit halfway. You must stay
in the mortal world to help them

22:17.500 --> 22:23.100
When they return, you'll become their
guardian deity. Isn't that good?

22:23.500 --> 22:26.100
You just want me to stay
in the mortal world

22:26.500 --> 22:31.500
Oh yes, why is there a Golden Swallow?
Why does everyone take me for her?

22:31.500 --> 22:33.500
She isn't in my plan

22:33.500 --> 22:39.500
People might have mistaken you for her
when you helped the Trio

22:39.500 --> 22:46.100
All the better. You can use her
as a cover to hide your real identity

22:46.500 --> 22:49.100
You must never reveal you're an immortal

22:49.100 --> 22:51.100
But of course.
I'm not so stupid

22:52.100 --> 22:55.500
Good. Carry on your duty
as Golden Swallow

22:55.500 --> 22:59.500
Besides guarding the Trio,
I still have to be a constable?

22:59.500 --> 23:03.100
There's no turning back now.
Just do it

23:05.500 --> 23:06.500
Look!

23:07.500 --> 23:10.500
This is Yurong Paste from Chang E

23:13.500 --> 23:17.500
And this is Xianlu lotion
from He Xiangu

23:19.500 --> 23:24.500
Apply them on your face. Your freckles
will go off in less than 3 days

23:24.500 --> 23:26.500
I specially got them for you, you know

23:26.500 --> 23:31.100
Aren't you resourceful. I've asked Chang
E for it a few times but was turned down

23:31.100 --> 23:33.100
Get me a few more bottles next time

23:33.500 --> 23:38.500
I won't have to worry about my complexion
however bad the mortal environment is

23:54.500 --> 24:00.100
The constables risked their lives
and found this piece of evidence

24:00.100 --> 24:02.100
What have you go to say?

24:02.500 --> 24:06.100
Your Excellency, that isn't mine...

24:06.500 --> 24:10.100
Why were the bombs put in your chest
of all the chests then?

24:10.100 --> 24:12.500
I don't know

24:12.500 --> 24:16.500
I do! You're in cahoots
with Joined Brow!

24:16.500 --> 24:18.500
Men, take her back with us!

24:18.500 --> 24:20.500
I'm innocent...!

24:22.500 --> 24:26.500
You're back, Wu Fuqi.
I thought you'd gone into hiding

24:26.500 --> 24:28.500
She's innocent.
Let her go

24:28.500 --> 24:30.500
If she's innocent,
you must be guilty then

24:30.500 --> 24:35.500
Indeed the bombs were mine.
My mother was in the dark. Let her go

24:35.500 --> 24:38.500
You're saying you collaborated
with Joined Brow?

24:38.500 --> 24:42.500
That's right. I'm responsible for
everything. Arrest me if you must

24:51.500 --> 24:54.500
Aren't you free, young man

24:57.500 --> 24:59.500
You don't understand

24:59.500 --> 25:05.100
Studying frantically at the last minute
isn't going to help at all

25:06.500 --> 25:09.500
You sound rather conceited

25:09.500 --> 25:14.500
I suppose you read widely and are
confident in coming out top in the exam?

25:16.500 --> 25:21.500
Reading is interesting
but exams are meaningless

25:21.500 --> 25:26.500
All the more so when the person
marking your paper is of low calibre

25:28.500 --> 25:30.500
Why did you still come here then?

25:30.500 --> 25:36.500
It's my father's wish I sit the exams.
This is a piece of cake to me anyway

25:36.500 --> 25:39.500
So I just humour him

25:40.500 --> 25:44.500
Let me tell you frankly.
I hate officials

25:44.500 --> 25:51.500
They're nothing but toadies
who sit on the fence!

26:05.500 --> 26:08.500
-You know who that man was?
-Who was he?

26:08.500 --> 26:12.100
My uncle Zha Daoguang,
nicknamed Blink Blink

26:12.500 --> 26:16.100
All-sucked-up (zha dao guang)?
So?

26:17.500 --> 26:21.100
He's the chief examiner this year

26:32.500 --> 26:35.500
-You're Wei Delu?
-Yes. It's written in there

26:37.500 --> 26:39.500
Where are you from?

26:39.500 --> 26:41.500
It's written in there

26:42.500 --> 26:47.500
Did you drop from Heaven or
did you come out from the ground?

26:47.500 --> 26:50.100
There's no such place

26:54.500 --> 26:57.500
This is the character "yu"

26:57.500 --> 27:03.100
It's "yu" as in stupidity,
benightedness, and ignorance

27:03.100 --> 27:08.100
I was born here. They've changed the name
of the place. This is no longer used

27:11.500 --> 27:16.300
Since it no longer exists,
where are you from?

27:18.500 --> 27:21.500
You can't be more dull.
I won't argue with you

27:22.500 --> 27:27.100
Doubtful background. He's disqualified
from sitting the exams! Take him away!

27:28.500 --> 27:32.500
Blame it on your ignorance!
I want to see the Chief Examiner!

27:32.500 --> 27:33.500
Quiet!

27:36.100 --> 27:38.100
Are you all right, Young Master?

27:38.500 --> 27:39.500
Yes

28:06.500 --> 28:09.500
Why cover your face?
Too ashamed to face anyone?

28:09.500 --> 28:13.100
Speak for yourself.
You're forever wearing a veil

28:13.500 --> 28:17.300
Shouldn't you be sitting your exam?
Did you offend someone again?

28:17.500 --> 28:19.500
I only argued strongly
on just ground

28:20.500 --> 28:24.100
Didn't I tell you to
watch your tongue?

28:24.100 --> 28:27.500
I didn't say anything wrong.
Not sitting the exam is no big deal

28:27.500 --> 28:32.300
If you miss it this year, you'll have
to wait so long for the next one!

28:35.300 --> 28:39.300
I'm the one sitting the exams, not you.
Why are you so worked up?

28:40.500 --> 28:44.300
All three of you are incorrigible!

28:52.100 --> 28:55.100
Abracadabra...!
Luck is with me and not you!

28:56.500 --> 29:01.100
Small!
There goes your meat. Sorry!

29:03.500 --> 29:06.500
-Take him to the cell next door
-Yes, Madam!

29:07.500 --> 29:09.500
Where are you taking him?

29:10.500 --> 29:13.500
Just what do you want?
Why did you take him away?

29:13.500 --> 29:20.100
I'll inform Magistrate Shi. Isn't it
better now that there's more room?

29:20.100 --> 29:22.100
Have you done your homework?

29:22.500 --> 29:25.500
-What homework?
-Memorize the 10 Commandments

29:25.500 --> 29:27.500
The 10 Commandments?

29:29.500 --> 29:31.500
You tore it up?!

29:32.500 --> 29:36.500
It's in shreds now.
Feel disheartened, eh?

29:37.500 --> 29:40.300
Since you like gambling so much,
let's have a bet

29:40.300 --> 29:44.300
Sure! But what will I
stand to gain if I win?

29:44.500 --> 29:49.500
If I lose, you'll get 10 taels.
How's that?

29:49.500 --> 29:51.500
You're on!

29:51.500 --> 29:55.100
I bet that you can't finish copying
the 10 Commandments before sunset

29:55.100 --> 29:57.100
Can you tell me
what the 10 commandments are?

29:57.100 --> 29:59.500
Isn't it on the floor?

30:55.100 --> 30:57.100
Such illegible handwriting!

30:57.500 --> 31:04.100
You never said I had to write neatly.
I've won. Now you mustn't welsh on me

31:05.500 --> 31:09.100
All right, you win today.
I'll come back tomorrow

31:09.100 --> 31:10.500
Whatever for?

31:10.500 --> 31:12.500
To gamble with you again.
Are you scared?

31:12.500 --> 31:15.100
Of course not!
You're on!

31:15.300 --> 31:17.500
One for you, one for me

31:23.500 --> 31:25.500
Why did you hit me?

31:25.500 --> 31:28.100
I told you to practise your exercise!

31:28.500 --> 31:34.500
But I did. I practised for 2 hours and
felt hungry, so I came here with Jiujin

31:34.500 --> 31:35.500
Right?

31:37.300 --> 31:39.300
-Is that so?
-Yes

31:39.500 --> 31:45.100
I'm showing good progress.
See how strong I've become

31:45.500 --> 31:49.500
Look at my muscles.
I can even kill two tigers

31:52.300 --> 31:54.300
You're breaking my arm!
Let go!

31:54.300 --> 31:58.500
You have no strength at all!
Do you do the exercise or not?!

31:58.500 --> 32:04.100
Yes... I've memorized the strokes, but
I have a weak foundation, that's why

32:04.500 --> 32:06.500
Not so hard, please...

32:08.500 --> 32:11.500
You've memorized the strokes?
Recite them to me then

32:11.500 --> 32:15.100
-What's the first line?
-Too tense to do it off hand?

32:15.500 --> 32:18.500
Yes... You're so understanding

32:18.500 --> 32:21.500
Take out the book and see then

32:21.500 --> 32:23.500
The book...?

32:23.500 --> 32:25.500
Jiujin, where's the book?

32:26.500 --> 32:28.500
You've even forgotten the book?

32:29.500 --> 32:32.100
It must be in my study...

32:33.500 --> 32:37.500
I found this in a drain near your house.
You actually threw it away!

32:41.500 --> 32:43.500
Don't you dare hit me again!

32:43.500 --> 32:49.100
We aren't related at all.
Why do you keep hitting me?

32:49.100 --> 32:53.100
If you like to teach so much, just
grab any man and bear him children!

32:53.100 --> 32:56.500
You can teach them any way
you like then! Leave me alone!

32:56.500 --> 32:57.500
Let's go!

32:58.500 --> 32:59.500
Why, you...!

33:00.100 --> 33:02.100
I need a sedan!

33:03.100 --> 33:06.100
-Let me carry you
-No, I'll go home on my own

33:06.500 --> 33:08.500
You're not going anywhere!

33:11.100 --> 33:13.100
This doesn't concern you.
You may go

33:13.500 --> 33:16.500
Wait! Take me home.
I'll pay you 10 wen more

33:16.500 --> 33:19.500
I'll give you 1 tael.
Leave this minute

33:19.500 --> 33:21.100
Thanks!

33:24.500 --> 33:28.500
Did I do you wrong in a previous life?
Why do you keep antagonizing me?

33:28.500 --> 33:32.500
Your house is only a stone's throw away
yet you didn't even want to walk!

33:32.500 --> 33:36.100
Go on like this and your health
will deteriorate!

33:36.100 --> 33:39.500
You mean me well.
I appreciate your kindness

33:39.500 --> 33:42.500
You may go.
I'll walk home

33:43.100 --> 33:45.100
You don't trust me?

33:52.500 --> 33:55.100
Bearers...!

33:55.500 --> 33:57.500
Why didn't you wait for me?

33:58.500 --> 34:00.100
Let's go

34:03.500 --> 34:05.500
-You had me on!
-So what?

34:05.500 --> 34:08.500
-Move on...
-No! Get off!

34:08.500 --> 34:09.500
Move on!

34:09.500 --> 34:13.500
-Get off!
-No!

34:13.500 --> 34:15.500
I said get off!

34:24.500 --> 34:30.100
Building roads and bridges
is a good deed indeed! Bah!

34:30.500 --> 34:33.500
She's just like the tofu
Ma-po is selling

34:33.500 --> 34:35.500
What's the connection between them?

34:35.500 --> 34:40.100
Hot and spicy -
doesn't that describe her best?

34:40.100 --> 34:44.100
So you've been antagonizing her.
No wonder she's always picking on you

34:44.100 --> 34:46.100
And I suffer as a result

34:46.500 --> 34:49.500
See, they don't have to do anything

34:50.500 --> 34:52.500
This isn't fair at all!

34:56.500 --> 34:59.100
Spicy woman, it's unfair!

34:59.500 --> 35:05.100
Why do we have to do all these chores
while they can lie idle?

35:05.500 --> 35:10.500
Your duty is to build roads and bridges
while theirs is to raise funds

35:10.500 --> 35:12.500
This is division of labour

35:13.100 --> 35:15.500
Indeed!
You don't allocate work evenly!

35:16.500 --> 35:20.100
We're toiling but
they don't even need to sweat!

35:20.500 --> 35:24.100
I see nothing wrong with that.
What do you want?

35:25.500 --> 35:27.500
I want to join them

35:29.500 --> 35:33.500
It's tough raising funds. Don't say
I didn't warn you. Don't regret it

35:33.500 --> 35:35.500
I won't!

35:36.500 --> 35:37.500
Go...

35:53.500 --> 35:57.100
No skiving!
Get cracking!

35:58.500 --> 36:03.500
We weren't skiving. Nobody passes by.
What can we do?

36:04.100 --> 36:09.100
This place is deserted. It's no point
coming up with good ideas

36:09.100 --> 36:10.100
Is that so?

36:12.100 --> 36:17.100
But I think if an idea is good,
there will be no lack of donations

36:19.500 --> 36:21.500
Just what is she up to?

36:21.500 --> 36:26.100
They were right. Anybody who sticks
with you will end up in a bad patch!

36:26.500 --> 36:32.100
Attention, everybody!
These people are criminals

36:32.500 --> 36:36.100
They've committed heinous crimes

36:36.100 --> 36:40.100
Today, they're casting
their pride and ego aside,

36:40.100 --> 36:44.100
and exposing themselves to ridicule
so as to raise funds for public use

36:44.500 --> 36:49.500
Listen good! If you donate 1 wen,
you can throw stones at them

36:49.500 --> 36:53.100
For 3 wen,
you can throw cow dung at them

36:53.500 --> 36:57.100
And for 5 wen,
you can throw rotten eggs!

37:00.500 --> 37:05.100
Wretched woman! If I ever get my hands
on you, I'll strip you and parade you!

37:06.500 --> 37:09.500
You bad woman!
You'll be left on the shelf!

37:16.100 --> 37:21.100
If I ever get a chance,
I'll get back at you!

37:21.500 --> 37:23.500
Wait till you're able to do that

37:23.500 --> 37:28.500
I already told you it wasn't easy to
raise funds but you didn't believe me

37:28.500 --> 37:30.500
Who can you blame?

37:30.500 --> 37:34.100
Cut the crap!
We need to go back to jail to wash

37:34.100 --> 37:35.100
Hurry!

37:35.100 --> 37:39.100
Who says you can go back? The money
isn't enough. You must work night shift

37:39.500 --> 37:44.500
We're filthy and you still think
we didn't raise enough money?!

37:44.500 --> 37:48.500
You think you're worth a lot?
Every throw was only a few wen

37:48.500 --> 37:52.100
How much are you short of?
I'll go and rob

37:52.100 --> 37:55.100
We're 10 taels short.
Get me the money if you're so capable

37:55.500 --> 37:59.300
Didn't you tell me this morning
you had 10 taels?

38:01.100 --> 38:05.100
Did I? I was only joking.
I don't have it

38:05.100 --> 38:07.100
I heard you distinctly

38:07.100 --> 38:12.100
No... Like you said,
I couldn't possibly have 10 taels

38:12.100 --> 38:15.500
Yes, you do. I lost 10 taels to you
the other day, remember?

38:15.500 --> 38:18.100
You can't have spent it
since you're in jail

38:18.500 --> 38:24.100
Take out the money, buddy. I'll
take you along the next time I rob

38:24.500 --> 38:27.900
You can have all the money
you want then

38:28.500 --> 38:33.100
You ought to respect
your teacher's fellow disciple too

38:34.500 --> 38:36.500
All right, I'll take out the money!

38:39.500 --> 38:44.500
Spicy woman! Darn you!
Just you wait!

38:47.500 --> 38:52.100
What a spread! It's been ages
since I last had such delicacies!

38:52.100 --> 38:54.100
-Uncle!
-Come, Jiujin

38:54.500 --> 38:56.500
There's a lot of food.
What would you like?

38:59.500 --> 39:02.100
Going to take my food away?

39:02.500 --> 39:07.100
Sorry about the other day.
I'm here to offer my apologies

39:07.100 --> 39:13.100
Knowing you're a gourmet,
I've prepared some goodies for you

39:13.100 --> 39:15.500
Would you be so kind?
What are the goodies?

39:15.500 --> 39:18.500
You're weak.
These dishes are no good for you

39:18.500 --> 39:20.500
Chunhua, take them away

39:22.500 --> 39:26.500
The chicken is too fat, and the stewed
duck, too "cold". Take them away too

39:27.500 --> 39:31.100
You have a weak stomach.
No sour food either

39:31.500 --> 39:33.500
-Jiujin
-Yes, Ma-jiejie?

39:33.500 --> 39:36.500
Uncle can't eat this.
Can you take it away?

39:37.100 --> 39:39.100
I can't even eat fish?

39:39.100 --> 39:42.500
Cool down and see what
I've cooked for you

39:43.500 --> 39:47.100
Veg with dried lizards,
steamed silkworms,

39:47.500 --> 39:51.300
lotus soup with seahorses,
and stewed centipedes!

39:53.500 --> 39:56.100
Are all these edible?

39:57.500 --> 39:58.500
Mother...!

39:58.500 --> 40:00.500
Mother!

40:00.500 --> 40:04.500
What are you screaming for?
You're making yourself a laughing-stock

40:04.500 --> 40:09.500
Look what food she's giving me!
She's trying to poison me to death!

40:10.100 --> 40:12.100
Miss Ma...

40:12.500 --> 40:15.500
These are medicated dishes
I've prepared for your son

40:15.500 --> 40:17.500
Medicated dishes?

40:18.500 --> 40:23.500
Seahorses, centipedes, silkworms and
lizards will all help to build him up

40:23.500 --> 40:27.500
If he takes them on a long-term basis
and also does the Five-Animal Exercise,

40:27.500 --> 40:29.500
he'll recover without medication

40:30.500 --> 40:35.100
Don't believe her, Mother.
We don't know her background at all

40:35.500 --> 40:41.500
And she wants me to imitate animals.
What's her motive?

40:41.500 --> 40:45.500
Now she even wants me to eat these!
She's obviously up to no good!

40:45.500 --> 40:49.500
Nonsense! It's recorded in ancient books
these things can be used as medicines

40:49.500 --> 40:51.500
You can check them up

40:52.500 --> 40:57.100
And if we exchange pointers on the Five-
Animal Exercise, you'll know what I mean

40:57.500 --> 41:01.500
You're well-versed in martial arts.
I'm no match for you

41:02.500 --> 41:06.100
I won't be the one taking you on
but Jiujin!

41:06.100 --> 41:07.100
Jiujin?!

41:08.500 --> 41:10.500
Just give her a hard punch!

41:12.500 --> 41:19.100
I'm not so stupid! She weighs 9 jin
and I, 190 jin. What if I kill her?

41:19.100 --> 41:21.100
She isn't afraid at all

41:21.100 --> 41:22.100
Right?

41:27.500 --> 41:30.500
Now, don't get me into trouble

41:31.500 --> 41:33.500
All right, here I go

41:46.500 --> 41:48.500
Jiujin, how did you do that?

41:48.500 --> 41:49.500
Well done!

41:50.500 --> 41:55.500
I only taught her a stroke from the
Exercise this morning and she beat you

41:55.500 --> 42:01.100
The Five-Animal Exercise was invented
by Hua Tuo. It's best for weak people

42:01.100 --> 42:04.100
Practising the basic strokes
builds you up

42:04.100 --> 42:08.100
If you learn more, the Exercise
can even be used for self-defence

42:08.100 --> 42:13.100
It enables weak people to counter
strong opponents with little strength

42:13.100 --> 42:15.100
That was how Jiujin beat you

42:15.500 --> 42:20.500
Miss Ma, you're really good to Shou.
From now on, we'll do everything you say

42:20.500 --> 42:23.500
I'll throw away all the medicines,

42:23.500 --> 42:28.100
and see that Shou practises
the Exercise and eats these dishes

42:29.500 --> 42:32.100
Where's justice...?

42:51.100 --> 42:53.100
Is it you, Teacher?

42:55.500 --> 42:58.500
-Where's Gem-faced Leopard?
-They've put him in another cell

43:08.500 --> 43:10.500
Brother, I'm over here!

43:10.500 --> 43:12.500
I've come to get you out!

43:12.500 --> 43:14.500
Do it, quick!

43:17.500 --> 43:19.500
Let's get out of here first

43:19.500 --> 43:20.500
Quick!

43:29.500 --> 43:33.500
-Golden Swallow! Fu, did you...
-Nothing of the sort!

43:33.500 --> 43:37.100
This is none of your business!
Get lost!

43:37.100 --> 43:39.100
I'll never let you leave with them!

43:39.100 --> 43:41.100
Come on,
it's not as if I were your son!

44:27.500 --> 44:28.500
It's fake!

45:00.500 --> 45:02.500
Subtitled by S Lin
